Q: Add element at specific position in XML-file C# A: <p>Try something like this, each Note element is replaced:</p>

<pre><code>var query=from n in xml.Root.Descendants("Note")
    select n;


foreach(var elem in query.ToList())
    elem.ReplaceWith(new XElement("notedate", new XAttribute("date", "date here"), elem));
</code></pre>
